  "local_policies": [
    "Caria chooses one current physical own-deck Demon uniformly per physical card, freezes its current local recipe and transforms the original self to6/6 before notification; the original deck card remains in place. Current tribe filtering and no eligible target use ordinary zone/tribe readers and no empty RNG draw.",
    "Morrigan uses an actually running original Deathrattle and one original physical deck minion, preserving the selected fixed deck slot rather than shuffling the whole deck. Her original physical source returns to that slot, reset by the ordinary lifecycle; no fake new copy or death is created. An unpublished SETASIDE staging move is used only to exchange an own-board source at capacity, then both writes finish before the first entry notification. If the source is already in this actor deck during a repeated DR, it is not duplicated or reinserted; the next actual DR still independently recruits, possibly the same original Morrigan. Empty eligible deck or unavailable board space is known empty without RNG. Other-controller stored outgoing sources remain explicit unsupported transfer boundaries, never silently skipped.",
    "Floop captures only native hand candidates already held at the original submitted own minion play; executes after its successful completed actual play, excluding later draws/copies/new residences and countered/effect summons/opponent plays. Original frozen played face and innate composition are used even if the actual board entity later transformed or left. Each transformation resets prior local state, sets removable3/4 and cost4, and restores only its own original native binding. Current held copies retain current face with fresh own binding and empty prior witnesses; ordinary leave-hand retires the mimic. Exact current CN windows, copied intrinsic recipes and external transform timing remain deferred.",
    "Zerek uses existing typed targeted_spells Deathrattle memory of actual successful accepted friendly spell arrows, including actual final secondary arrows, before payload/reactions. Area damage without an arrow and opponent casts do not activate it. Sticky original accepted links survive ordinary current copies/control under the existing copier; silence/reset retires them. One or many links summon one fresh printed Zerek per actual DR, which has empty memory; early actual DR does not forge a DeathRecord or consume the original activation. Exact official activation timing and historical donor-specific differences remain recorded.",
    "Sathrovarr freezes one original current friendly board minion before the first copy notification. Ordinary CopyCard handles HAND then DECK with battlefield injury reset; original remembered current copy material handles BOARD, retaining original local effects but recalculating derived auras. Later source mutations/leaves/reentry never replace the accepted recipe. Per-zone capacity, ownership of new copies, entry quantity/colossal, RNG, choices and notifications remain the original public executors. Exact current CN multi-zone ordering remains a local policy.",
    "Raw full bilingual sources and all732 original candidate identities remain unchanged; this batch does not bind the full MIS_701 past source, add Wild-only scope or certify formal generation eligibility. Version/hotfix/CN boundary calibration remains deferred without waiting for user tests."
  ]
}
